  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6645150,
    "dDurationMs": 9294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " So where I'm getting at with that is the other day, my son was a little rough with my daughter, and I grabbed him by the arm, and I remember grabbing him pretty hard."
